.TH DANBY-SLIDINGPENDULUM2 1
.SH NAME
danby-slidingpendulum2 \- pendulum on an elastic sliding support
.SH DESCRIPTION
This variant attaches the sliding support to a spring and damper.  Energy moves
between the cart mode and pendulum mode, exposing beats and internal resonance.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
